e  role the reason given was so that  gandolfini could continue developing the  limited series the night of with the  network tragically it wouldn't premiere  until three years after his death it  speculated that they also wanted to  preserve the tough guy legacy of tony  soprano and were concerned that a  sillier role in the office might detract  from that the harry potter franchise is  no stranger to recent controversies  between the disappointing critical and  commercial reception of the most recent  film and author j.k rowling's  controversial statements the last thing  these spin-offs needed was one of its  primary cast members in hot water yet  that's precisely what happened with  johnny depp who had been cast as the  villainous gellert grindelwald in a  surprise cameo at the end of fantastic  beasts and where to find them he later  had his role significantly fleshed out  in the sequel unfortunately for depp  personal drama began to overshadow his  acting career in the wake of a vicious  and highly public court battle with his  ex-wife amber heard the higher-ups at  warner brothers decided that being  associated with death was more trouble  than it was worth as a result the role  of grindelwald was recast with hannibal  star mass mikkelsen for the third film  still depp managed to pocket his full 16  million dollar salary for his original  contract  and contain your emotions  with a body of work ranging from classy  oscar fair to schlocky action thrillers  and everything in between nicholas  cage's career is the stuff of legend yet  one of the actors most infamous roles  was when he never got the chance to play  this of course was the title character  of the equally legendary superman lives  it was a superhero blockbuster that  would have been helmed by tim burton  with a script by kevin smith it seemed  like a match made in comic book heaven  however the film was not to be though an  official reason was never given many  have speculated that it may have to do